      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The settings that apply to every scene live in an asset, not on an object. The URP Asset holds HDR, anti-aliasing, the Depth and Opaque Textures, Grading Mode and the shadows. Shadows > Max Distance is how far from the camera shadows are drawn; here it is 50 m.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You set Max Distance from 50 to 10. What happens to the shadow of the column 20 m from this station's camera?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Look through Camera - 2 in the Game view.\n2. Select PC_RPAsset (Assets/Settings) and set Shadows > Max Distance to 10. Look at the columns.\n3. Set Max Distance back to 50.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 9 \xB7 The course's global settings</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
