  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Under every scene lie two default Volume Profiles: the project's, in Project Settings > Graphics, and the one in the active URP Asset (Volumes > Volume Profile), which overrides it. A scene's Volume overrides both, but only for the overrides and properties it ticks. What it leaves unticked, the defaults still set.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You put VP_Asset-Vignette, a profile with a Vignette, into PC_RPAsset's Volume Profile. The scene's Volume has no Vignette. Is there a vignette in the frame?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Look through Camera - 5. Drag VP_Asset-Vignette (this sample's folder) into PC_RPAsset > Volumes > Volume Profile.\n2. Select Volume - Scene (global) and read its overrides.\n3. Set PC_RPAsset's Volume Profile back to None.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 9 \xB7 The course's global settings</color></size>"
