  m_text: "<b>13 \xB7 URP and the global settings</b>\n<size=60%><b>Row 1 \xB7 Where the settings live:</b> 1 What a render pipeline is \xB7 2 The URP Asset \xB7 3 The Renderer and its features \xB7 4 Which asset is active \xB7 5 The default Volume Profiles\n<b>Row 2 \xB7 The frame:</b> 6 How a frame is built \xB7 7 Anti-aliasing \xB7 8 Linear colour\n<b>9 \xB7 The course's global settings</b> (reference wall)</size>\n\n<size=50%>These stations change the project's real settings, which every scene uses. The last step of each station sets the setting back.</size>"
