  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The URP Asset points to a Renderer, another asset. The Renderer sets the Rendering Path (Forward, Forward+ or Deferred; this project uses Forward+) and lists the renderer features: extra passes added to every frame, such as Decal, Screen Space Ambient Occlusion, Screen Space Reflection and the volumetric fog.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You untick the Decal feature on the Renderer. What happens to the stain on this floor?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select PC_Renderer (Assets/Settings) and find Decal under Renderer Features.\n2. Untick it and look at the floor.\n3. Tick it again.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Weathering-Decals, 1 \xB7 A decal is a box</color></size>"
